@prefix lg: <https://laclaugpt.org/ontology/> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .

lg:Document a rdfs:Class .
lg:Actor a rdfs:Class .
lg:Concept a rdfs:Class .
lg:Signifier a rdfs:Class .
lg:EmptySignifier a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf lg:Signifier .
lg:FloatingSignifier a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf lg:Signifier .
lg:NodalPoint a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf lg:Signifier .
lg:Articulation a rdfs:Class .
lg:Equivalence a rdfs:Class .
lg:Difference a rdfs:Class .
lg:Antagonism a rdfs:Class .
lg:Frontier a rdfs:Class .
lg:Affect a rdfs:Class .
lg:AnalysisAssertion a rdfs:Class .
lg:AnalysisRun a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Activity .

lg:sourceDocument a rdf:Property .
lg:subject a rdf:Property .
lg:object a rdf:Property .
lg:relation a rdf:Property .
lg:articulates a rdf:Property .
lg:equivalentTo a rdf:Property .
lg:differentFrom a rdf:Property .
lg:antagonisticTo a rdf:Property .
lg:constructsFrontier a rdf:Property .
lg:expressesAffect a rdf:Property .
lg:surfaceForm a rdf:Property .
lg:confidence a rdf:Property .
lg:analysisMethod a rdf:Property .
lg:model a rdf:Property .
lg:modelVersion a rdf:Property .
lg:promptVersion a rdf:Property .
lg:validated a rdf:Property .
